<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ doc_label }} {{ doc_no }}</title>
<style>
/* ===========================================================================
   云枢 ERP 调拨单模板（PDF-04：仓间调拨）
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   结构：页眉（公司名 + 单据标题）→ 调拨路线条（调出仓 ➜ 调入仓）→ 单据头
        （单号 / 调拨日期 / 状态 / 在途仓 / 经办人 …）→ 明细（含调出库位 +
        调入库位 + 单位成本）→ 合计 → 事由 / 备注 → 签字栏 → 页脚。

   打印四条铁律（与订单 / 出入库模板同源）：
     ① @page 定死纸张与外边距；
     ② thead { display: table-header-group } —— 明细跨页时表头重复；
     ③ tr / .sign / .summary / .route { break-inside: avoid } —— 不腰斩；
     ④ .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums } —— 数量金额等宽右对齐。

   页码（「第 X 页 / 共 Y 页」）由 CDP footerTemplate 输出
   （`pdf::template::transfer_footer`），HTML 里刻意不放占位符。
   =========================================================================== */
@page {
  size: A4 portrait;
  margin: 12mm 10mm 16mm 10mm;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", sans-serif;
  font-size: 10pt;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: #1f2329;
  word-break: break-word;
}

/* ---------- 页眉 ---------- */
.sheet-header {
  border-bottom: 1.5pt solid #1f2329;
  padding-bottom: 4pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
.sheet-header .company {
  font-size: 12.5pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1pt;
}
.sheet-header .doc-title {
  font-size: 17pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  letter-spacing: 8pt;
  margin: 4pt 0 6pt;
}

/* ---------- 调拨路线条（验收②：调出 / 调入仓库一眼可见） ---------- */
.route {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  border: 0.8pt solid #1f2329;
  background: #f7f8fa;
  padding: 5pt 8pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
  font-size: 11pt;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10pt;
}
.route .wh { font-weight: 700; }
.route .arrow { font-size: 12pt; color: #1f2329; }
.route .via { font-size: 9pt; color: #4e5969; }

/* ---------- 单据头 ---------- */
table.head-fields {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
table.head-fields td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #c9cdd4;
  padding: 3pt 5pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.head-fields td.label {
  width: 62pt;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  color: #4e5969;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.head-fields td.value { width: auto; }

/* ---------- 明细表 ---------- */
table.detail {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9pt;
}
table.detail thead { display: table-header-group; }
table.detail th,
table.detail td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  padding: 2.4pt 3.5pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.detail th {
  background: #f2f3f5;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.detail tr { break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid; }
table.detail td.c-seq { text-align: center; width: 22pt; }
/* 列宽实测口径（PDF-04）：编码整串不折行；规格 66pt —— 56pt 会把 DN100/PN16 折成
   「DN100/PN」+「16」两行（实测 145 的 pdftotext），66pt 才整串一行 */
table.detail td.c-code { width: 76pt; white-space: nowrap; }
table.detail td.c-name { width: auto; }
table.detail td.c-spec { width: 66pt; }
table.detail td.c-unit { text-align: center; width: 26pt; }
table.detail td.c-qty { width: 44pt; }
table.detail td.c-from { width: 52pt; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
table.detail td.c-to { width: 52pt; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
table.detail td.c-cost { width: 50pt; }
table.detail td.c-amount { width: 56pt; }
table.detail td.c-code,
table.detail td.c-name,
table.detail td.c-spec { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

.num {
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  font-feature-settings: "tnum" 1;
  text-align: right;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* ---------- 合计区（整块不跨页） ---------- */
.summary {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  margin-top: 8pt;
}
.summary table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
}
.summary table td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  padding: 3pt 5pt;
}
.summary .label {
  width: 80pt;
  text-align: center;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.summary .value-cn { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3pt; }

/* ---------- 调出 / 调入签字栏 ---------- */
.sign {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  margin-top: 12pt;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8pt;
  font-size: 9pt;
}
.sign .box { flex: 1 1 0; }
.sign .cap { color: #4e5969; white-space: nowrap; }
.sign .line { margin-top: 16pt; border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #4e5969; height: 1pt; }
.sign .date { margin-top: 3pt; color: #86909c; font-size: 8.5pt; }

.remark {
  margin-top: 9pt;
  font-size: 8.8pt;
  color: #4e5969;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.remark .tag { font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329; }

.footnote {
  margin-top: 5pt;
  font-size: 7.5pt;
  color: #86909c;
  text-align: right;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet-header">
  <div class="company">{{ company }}</div>
  <div class="doc-title">{{ doc_title }}</div>
</div>

<div class="route">
  <span class="wh">调出：{{ from_warehouse }}</span>
  <span class="arrow">➜</span>
  <span class="wh">调入：{{ to_warehouse }}</span>
{% if transit_warehouse %}
  <span class="via">（在途经 {{ transit_warehouse }}）</span>
{% endif %}
</div>

<table class="head-fields">
{% for row in meta_rows %}
  <tr>
{% for field in row %}
    <td class="label">{{ field.label }}</td>
    <td class="value">{{ field.value }}</td>
{% endfor %}
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>

<table class="detail">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>#</th>
      <th>物料编码</th>
      <th>物料名称</th>
      <th>规格</th>
      <th>单位</th>
      <th>数量</th>
      <th>调出库位</th>
      <th>调入库位</th>
      <th>单位成本</th>
      <th>金额</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
{% for item in items %}
    <tr>
      <td class="c-seq">{{ item.seq }}</td>
      <td class="c-code">{{ item.material_code }}</td>
      <td class="c-name">{{ item.material_name }}</td>
      <td class="c-spec">{{ item.spec }}</td>
      <td class="c-unit">{{ item.unit }}</td>
      <td class="c-qty num">{{ item.qty }}</td>
      <td class="c-from">{{ item.from_location }}</td>
      <td class="c-to">{{ item.to_location }}</td>
      <td class="c-cost num">{{ item.unit_cost }}</td>
      <td class="c-amount num">{{ item.amount }}</td>
    </tr>
{% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="summary">
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">行数合计</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:56pt">{{ row_count }}</td>
      <td class="label">数量合计</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:80pt">{{ total_qty }}</td>
      <td class="label">成本金额合计（{{ currency }}）</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:96pt">{{ total_amount }}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">成本金额（大写）</td>
      <td colspan="5" class="value-cn">{{ currency_cn }}{{ amount_cn }}（{{ currency_symbol }}{{ amount_for_upper }}）</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

{% if reason %}
<div class="remark"><span class="tag">调拨事由：</span>{{ reason }}</div>
{% endif %}
{% if remark %}
<div class="remark"><span class="tag">备注：</span>{{ remark }}</div>
{% endif %}
<div class="remark"><span class="tag">说明：</span>调拨按「原价转移」计价，调入仓库不重算移动加权均价；金额 = 调拨数量 × 调出仓成本单价快照。</div>

<div class="sign">
{% for cap in sign_caps %}
  <div class="box">
    <div class="cap">{{ cap }}</div>
    <div class="line"></div>
    <div class="date">日期：__________</div>
  </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="footnote">打印时间：{{ printed_at }}　本单据由云枢系统生成（{{ engine }}）</div>
</body>
</html>
